{"name":"Almanack","hex":"#e8dec9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"almanack","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Archaic spelling of almanac."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/almanack"}],"entries":[{"title":"Almanac","blocks":[{"text":"An almanac is a regularly published listing of a set of current information about one or multiple subjects. It includes information like weather forecasts, farmers' planting dates, tide tables, and other tabular data often arranged according to the calendar. Celestial figures and various statistics are found in almanacs, such as the rising and setting times of the Sun and Moon, dates of eclipses, hours of high and low tides, and religious festivals. The set of events noted in an almanac may be tailored for a specific group of readers, such as farmers, sailors, or astronomers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/OldMooresAlmanac1862.jpg/330px-OldMooresAlmanac1862.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Almanac","wikidata":"Q171341"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff/lossy-page1-500px-The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff/lossy-page1-1280px-The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff/lossy-page1-500px-The_Horsford_1887_almanac_and_cook_book_%28page_1_crop%29.tiff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","al